= Static GK Map 3 — Geography and Polity Anchors

A compact set of evergreen anchors covers a surprising share of everyday-Knowledge questions. These do not change from cycle to cycle — learn them once, revise monthly, own them for life. Where a fact has a common swap-trap (largest vs longest, world vs India), the hook says so.

